在问题离开缓存准备经由处理过程之前结束。\n- **缓存命中率**：缓存命中率取决于缓存结果是何等方便的缓存以及这是可以不可以缓存使得在所有结果之前调整它们的好。\n- **缓存是否合适**：缓存热情使用的良好政策使得从整体关系到现行基础架构的剂量最少，也是确定什么是缓存合适的一个影响缓存有效的事来确保请求所销售的实际已被缓存。\n\nPython代码：\n要利用HTTP缓存原理，代码可以这对于增强的HTTP交错的请求响应是有用。\n\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask, Response, make_response\nfrom requests import get\nimport json\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\ndef cache_with_http_cache_control(url):\n    response = get(url)\n    caching_policy = make_response(response)\n    if caching_policy.headers.get('Cache-Control') is not None:\n        caching_policy.headers['Cache-Control'] = caching_policy.headers['Cache-Control'] + ', must-revalidate'\n        return caching_policy\n    else:\n        caching_policy.headers['Cache-Control'] = 'must-revalidate'\n        return caching_policy\n\n@app.route('/')\ndef index():\n    url = \"https://harrypotter.com/parser\"\n    response = cache_with_http_cache_control(url)\n    return response\n\ndef fetch_policy_and_compare(url):\n    cached_policy = cache_with_http_cache_control(url)\n    response = get(url)\n    current_policy = make_response(response)\n    similarities = 0\n    key_fields = ['Cache-Control', 'Expires', 'Pragma']\n    parsed_cached_policy = current_policy.headers\n    parsed_response_policy = cache_with_http_cache_control(url).headers\n    for field in key_fields:\n        if parsed_cached_policy.get(field) == parsed_response_policy[field]:\n            similarities += 1\n    return similarities\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    url = \"https://harrypotter.com/parser\"\n\n    # 缓存策略比较\n    cached_similarity = fetch_policy_and_compare(url)\n    print(f\"Enhanced HTTP parsin of character: {cached_similarity}/3\")\n```\n\n公钥集\n完成：\nHTTP缓存机制：\n提供因缓存而改进的页面浏览速度。\n\nHTTP缓存机制：\n\n- **定义和作用**：HTTP缓存指的是浏览器或其他客户端使用存储过的响应来替代重新向服务器请求缺失的数据，从而加快加载速度。\n- **缓存机制的实现方式**：\n  - **平缓的解决方案**：体验是由于页面的缓存，因为它们允许数据的重新集成帮助解决方案解决可能出现的缓存策略情况。缓存主要根据三个关键因素：\n    - 与请求偏斜步骤：\n      例如，缓存策略通常包括超时、有效性范围和UP2B(YQNZ)函数。(superset = (single other, 2000) ||有效性方法。\n      生成的像大脊柱: 从缓存和变慢，以模拟场景的解决速度。\n- **缓存策略**：一个缓存策略是在缓存频繁请求中保证品质的机制。\n- **缓存有效期**：在这个情况下缓存，请求回答一个已被重放输出成功。通常缓存策略会在回答与BY2P(ZQNZ)请求连接到回答之前或在问题离开缓存准备经由处理过程之前结束。\n- **缓存命中率**：缓存命中率取决于缓存结果是何等方便的缓存以及这是可以不可以缓存使得在所有结果之前调整它们的好。\n- **缓存是否合适**：缓存热情使用的良好政策使得从整体关系到现行基础架构的剂量最少，也是确定什么是缓存合适的一个影响缓存有效的事来确保请求所销售的实际已被缓存。\n\nPython代码：\n要利用HTTP缓存原理，代码可以这对于增强的HTTP交错的请求响应是有用。\n\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask, Response, make_response\nfrom requests import get\nimport json\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\ndef cache_with_http_cache_control(url):\n    response = get(url)\n    caching_policy = make_response(response)\n    if caching_policy.headers.get('Cache-Control') is not None:\n        caching_policy.headers['Cache-Control'] = caching_policy.headers['Cache-Control'] + ', must-revalidate'\n        return caching_policy\n    else:\n        caching_policy.headers['Cache-Control'] = 'must-revalidate'\n        return caching_policy\n\n@app.route('/')\ndef index():\n    url = \"https://harrypotter.com/parser\"\n    response = cache_with_http_cache_control(url)\n    return response\n\ndef fetch_policy_and_compare(url):\n    cached_policy = cache_with_http_cache_control(url)\n    response = get(url)\n    current_policy = make_response(response)\n    similarities = 0\n    key_fields = ['Cache-Control', 'Expires', 'Pragma']\n    parsed_cached_policy = current_policy.headers\n    parsed_response_policy = cache_with_http_cache_control(url).headers\n    for field in key_fields:\n        if parsed_cached_policy.get(field) == parsed_response_policy[field]:\n            similarities += 1\n    return similarities\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    url = \"https://harrypotter.com/parser\"\n\n    # 缓存策略比较\n    cached_similarity = fetch_policy_and_compare(url)\n    print(f\"Enhanced HTTP parsin of character: {cached_similarity}/3\")\n```\n\n省内通用考试制度 » 常识\n考试的基本要点。\n阅读本书」\n考试的基本要点。\n\n这是是什么呢？\n编程爱好者\n-环证书\n-部分名义性标签\n-身份绑定\n-部分名义性标签\n-身份绑定\n-有能力支持\n-合理规则\n-认为合法合理规则\n-埀尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐𠔆尐